{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_ex01_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_ex01","title":"大地驚雷","storyCode":"GT-EX-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"614dccc81355fb301244a0ea7f92a0c5d4668ee3f2dd3d542bcfc09c62226233","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......我們該把他塞進麻袋，\n在黎明時吊上桅杆......\n......我們該把他喉嚨切斷，\n在暴風雨裡獻給大海......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是這個夢嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"——原來是你。唔，不過為什麼我想不起來你叫什麼名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要。你把我當成一個普通的羅德島幹員就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你看上去似乎很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"只是噩夢而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"一些盤旋在意識裡的黑色碎片，藏在那個破碎教堂的陰影之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"在我接近它的時候，它們化為枷鎖將我拖入深邃的海中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不過很快你就有辦法脫離痛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，呵呵，那可真是太好了。不過我為什麼相信你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上的氣息......我很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是，是氣味。濃烈的氣味，血的氣味，它們的氣味。深邃的海中的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"熟悉，但又讓人厭惡的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"能告訴我你的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。那麼你為什麼能出現在這裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有凱爾希的許可，你可沒法到這個房間裡來，除非你也不怕被失去控制的我撕成碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕。所有人都害怕。只是我已經習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是時候出發了，回來的時候，情況也許會有所進展。不過，你也可以和以前一樣，把我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"秘密被埋葬的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"一個離你很遠的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["幽靈鯊"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？","斯卡蒂"]}]}
